<div class="col-lg-6">
    <h1 class="page-title">Modules and personalization</h1>
    <p>
Integrating ever more components and functionalities in a compact, aerodynamic front-end module demands great technical and logistical expertise.
And Plastic Omnium has just that. Today, that expertise is broadening to take in other parts of the vehicle, such as the cockpit and center console.
</p>
</div>
<div class="po-s2022-slide-spotlight-block col-lg-6">
    <div class="po-s2022-slide-spotlight">
